  sections:
  - heading: Welcome to CubeArena
    text: CubeArena is a fast-paced arena-style game built using the Universal Render Pipeline. This project is a task for PraxiLabs. Use WASD to control, mouse click to hit enemies, we have two types of enemies, week and strong.
